%
(TCPC work-config servo tuning: linear small-motion path)
(No probing. No TCPC/TWP entry. Operator must confirm safe clearance.)

G21 G17 G40 G54 G64 P0.001 G80 G90 G94

o<preview_guard> if [#<_task> EQ 0]
  (DEBUG, TCPC_SERVO_TUNE_LINEAR_SMALL preview only)
  M2
o<preview_guard> endif

o<tcpc_off_check> if [#<_hal[headheadtwp.tcpc_enabled]> GT 0.5]
  (abort, TCPC servo tune linear requires TCPC off)
o<tcpc_off_check> endif
o<twp_off_check> if [#<_hal[headheadtwp.motion_enabled]> GT 0.5]
  (abort, TCPC servo tune linear requires TWP off)
o<twp_off_check> endif

(MSG, Confirm safe clearance for +/-10 mm X/Y and +/-5 mm Z relative moves)
M0

G91
F600
G1 X10
G1 X-10
G1 Y10
G1 Y-10
G1 Z5
G1 Z-5

F1800
G1 X10
G1 X-10
G1 Y10
G1 Y-10
G1 Z5
G1 Z-5

G90
(DEBUG, TCPC_SERVO_TUNE_LINEAR_SMALL complete)
M30
